WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose a simulated model. For hardware, use discovery and start read-only.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sound-check coach: prepare the band, measure gain and review each proposal.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Expert mode: a channel and its processing, compressor and equalizer.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Compact mixer: channel strips, main mix, buses and effects depend on the model.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Monitors: each musician controls their bus. Limits depend on physical outputs.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Rehearsal notes: the draft and active setlist stay on this computer.
